        "60-95": 8000,
        "96-108": 16000
      }
    },
    "fidelity_reading": "the designed filters hold the passband flat to within 0.02 dB across +/- 25 cents - the published robustness claim - and reject the adjacent semitone centres by about 49.5 dB, meeting the 50 dB design target. Both published behavioural claims are reproduced.",
    "if_fidelity_cannot_be_established": "return CRP_PROBE_INCONCLUSIVE. Do NOT substitute the old C4."
